---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { site, disclaimers } from '../data/site';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Affiliate Disclosure | CheckVitalsNow"
  description="How CheckVitalsNow earns money through affiliate links, how those links work, and why commissions never decide what we say about a product."
  h1="Affiliate Disclosure"
>
  <blockquote>{disclaimers.affiliate}</blockquote>

  <h2>What this means</h2>
  <p>
    {site.name} is free to read. To pay for it, some links on our site are affiliate links. When you click one and buy
    something, the seller or an affiliate network may pay us a commission. You do not pay more because you used our link.
  </p>
  <p>
    We work with affiliate networks such as Digistore24 and with individual sellers. Which links are affiliate links can
    change over time.
  </p>

  <h2>How to recognize affiliate links</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Every page with affiliate links shows a disclosure at the top, before the first link.</li>
    <li>
      Affiliate links on our site go through a short address that starts with <code>/go/</code>, which then sends you to
      the seller's website.
    </li>
    <li>Buttons such as "Check Price on Official Website" are usually affiliate links.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Our independence</h2>
  <p>
    A commission never decides a product's score or its place in a list. Every review lists real downsides and a safety
    section, and we include products without affiliate links in our comparisons when they deserve a place. You can read
    how we score products in our <a href="/editorial-policy/">editorial policy</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Prices and offers</h2>
  <p>
    Prices, discounts, bonuses, and guarantees are set by the seller and can change at any time. Always confirm the
    current terms on the seller's official website before you buy. Your purchase is a contract between you and the
    seller, not {site.name}.
  </p>

  <h2>Why we tell you this</h2>
  <p>
    The U.S. Federal Trade Commission requires websites to disclose material connections with the brands they write
    about. We also think you deserve to know how the site makes money. Questions? Reach us through our
    <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.
  </p>
</PageLayout>
